## Maintenance contract

Keep each decision tag to a short continue, stop, redirect, or open conclusion and route each result directly to one matching packet. Put assumptions, validity limits, non-claims, exact values, and authoritative evidence in that packet or its linked active sources and verifiers. Update a topic packet when a durable result, limitation, evidence route, or active gap changes; update this index only when discovery routing or a stop/go decision changes.
